{"3322730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nocturnal Visitors: Book One", "steam_appid": 3322730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/137d509b78cc619b721cb63095a4e261.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/137d509b78cc619b721cb63095a4e261.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/137d509b78cc619b721cb63095a4e261.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One rainy night, sixteen-year-old Jamie witnesses a paranormal event in his own house. Shortly afterwards he is transported to Aliorbis, a mysterious alternate version of Earth where magic and science coexist in almost perfect harmony. The place where all the legends that we know of were born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, Jamie learns that he is what is known as a “Visitor”, someone who can cross the barrier that separates his world and Aliorbis. There he joins SEEK, an organization that investigates crimes that pose a threat to both worlds. Through his adventures in Aliorbis, Jamie slowly becomes acquainted with its dark and twisted past filled with corruption and chaos, and gradually begins to wonder if SEEK is truly on the right side of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6637e1ae063ae44b19a76e8eab5ca60b.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6637e1ae063ae44b19a76e8eab5ca60b.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6637e1ae063ae44b19a76e8eab5ca60b.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/f5aa16f078a9ab09f7b454f0e56c6406.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/f5aa16f078a9ab09f7b454f0e56c6406.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/f5aa16f078a9ab09f7b454f0e56c6406.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nocturnal Visitors: Book One </i>boasts a visual style inspired by games of the 2000s, with graphics straight out of the seventh generation of consoles. It's a nostalgic look into the games that  we 2000s kids  grew up with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/6564ac42403d161b61ee4a99f3fa380e.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/3711832ba595949c15c57f67723b4f5f.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/3711832ba595949c15c57f67723b4f5f.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/3711832ba595949c15c57f67723b4f5f.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as six different characters with unique storylines and points of views. Each of them have a story to tell. Each of them hold a piece of the overall puzzle that is <i>Nocturnal Visitor's </i>story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/18a1ca567f122576d8f6a6a1e0d68563.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/18a1ca567f122576d8f6a6a1e0d68563.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/18a1ca567f122576d8f6a6a1e0d68563.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c5fa94d8af82af5dddb7ddc46c81fc3f.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c5fa94d8af82af5dddb7ddc46c81fc3f.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c5fa94d8af82af5dddb7ddc46c81fc3f.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an immersive world with a carefully crafted lore. Investigate different scenarios filled with secrets. Everything is interactable. Everything is a clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/12c42cf26a387ba23e02175de5dbeac6.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/12c42cf26a387ba23e02175de5dbeac6.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/12c42cf26a387ba23e02175de5dbeac6.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c550926f12ad7ed103a02c67022ab400.poster.avif?t=1788018538\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c550926f12ad7ed103a02c67022ab400.webm?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/c550926f12ad7ed103a02c67022ab400.mp4?t=1788018538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling turn-based battles with and against different characters, and which outcome will shape the story. There is no &quot;game over&quot;. Whether you win or you lose, the story continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3322730/extras/4cc1075c9560eb4b3d